      "term": "Improving Training",
      "definition": "DATA AUGMENTATION\nApply realistic transformations (small rotations, crops, flips, brightness changes) to training images.\nREGULARIZATION\nSmall techniques that discourage overfitting:\nDropout : randomly disable some activations during training.\nWeight decay / L2 regularization : penalize excessively large weights.\nEarly stopping : stop training when validation performance stops improving.\nSave the best model, not the last epoch",
