      "definition": "- balancing Precision and Recall\n- the harmonic mean of Precision and Recall.\n- provides a single measure that balances the model's ability to make reliable positive predictions and identify actual positive cases.\nF1-Score = 2 × (Precision × Recall) / (Precision + Recall)\nOR F1-Score = 2TP / (2TP + FP + FN)",
