      "id": "ppt-datasets-091",
      "subject": "elective",
      "material": "terms",
      "term": "Model Evaluation",
      "definition": "Classification\nAccuracy: Proportion of correct predictions\nPrecision: Proportion of true positives among predicted positives\nRecall: Measures how many actual positives were correctly indentified.\nF1-score: Harmonic mean of precision and recall\nRegression\nMAE (Mean Absolute Error): Average absolute difference between predicted and actual values.\nMSE (Mean Squared Error): Average squared difference: MSE = (1/n) Σ(yᵢ − ŷᵢ).\nRMSE (Root Mean Squared Error): Square root of MSE, in the same units as the target.",
      "pdfWording": "Classification\nAccuracy: Proportion of correct predictions\nPrecision: Proportion of true positives among predicted positives\nRecall: Measures how many actual positives were correctly indentified.\nF1-score: Harmonic mean of precision and recall\nRegression\nMAE (Mean Absolute Error): Average absolute difference between predicted and actual values.\nMSE (Mean Squared Error): Average squared difference: MSE = (1/n) Σ(yᵢ − ŷᵢ).\nRMSE (Root Mean Squared Error): Square root of MSE, in the same units as the target.",
      "contentKind": "slide-excerpt",
      "questionStyle": "heading",
